fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7126407Z   ok   the tank has its own settlement ceiling, not the slab's
fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7126527Z   ok   which is the tank's own maximum
