fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7130954Z -- Mixing valve and the buffer tank as a store (items 27/29)
fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7131131Z   ok   without a valve the tank ignores the heat pump entirely
fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7131367Z   ok   with a valve, running the pump hard charges the tank
