fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7134508Z   ok   space COP never models below the resistive floor (cop_scale on its floor)
fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7134729Z   ok   DHW COP never models below the resistive floor (cop_scale on its floor)
fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7135069Z   ok   COP is non-decreasing in outdoor through the floored band (cop_scale on its floor)
