fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7136033Z   ok   the batched twin carries the COP floor: single-zone, learned scale on its floor
fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7136209Z   ok   a dumb valve is recommended the top of the comfort band
