fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7136667Z -- The discharge law: the valve regulates flow temperature (item 29)
fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7136908Z   ok   the flow setpoint is the target plus the standing loss over the emitter UA
