fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7158766Z   ok   the split is persisted alongside the other learned parameters
fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7158980Z   ok   the split learner runs before the one that consumes the baseline
