fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7486785Z -- v4.0.5 — DHW conservation: a cold tank cannot pour hot water
fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7487005Z   ok   the booked draw never exceeds the nominal demand
fast (3.14)	Run the suite	2026-10-08T21:05:21.7487189Z   ok   every step balances: in == out + losses + storage delta
